I've found that it's a good idea to engrave the E word on the down staircase,
just before descending.  The act of going down does not scuff the engraving,
so you can come back up and be standing on it.

That way, if you run into some nasties on the next level that are nasty
enough to follow you back up the stairs, you have a little protection.

